# The API as the PHONE reaches it: the laptop's IPv4 on the phone's hotspot,
# port 5000, with the /api mount. Read at BUNDLE time (EXPO_PUBLIC_* is inlined
# by Expo CLI), so after changing it restart `npx expo start`.
#
# Find the IP after joining the hotspot: `ipconfig` -> "Wireless LAN adapter
# Wi-Fi" -> IPv4 Address. `npx expo start` prints the same one in its exp:// URL.
# The Socket.io origin is derived from this by stripping /api — never set
# separately.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored by the root .gitignore's `.env` rule — verified
# with `git check-ignore mobile/.env` on 2026-09-27) and fill the IP in there.
# Since 2026-11-05 (D-246) the phone uses the hosted API on the domain:
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://chfes-main-parents-portal.online/api
# For a laptop API on the hotspot instead (the M5 proof order applies):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://<laptop-ip>:5000/api
